Constructing 2D inorganic perovskites and TMDs heterostructures is an eﬀective method to design stable
and high-performance perovskites optoelectronic applications. Here, we investigate the optoelectronic
properties and interfacial interactions of Cs2PbX4–MSe2 (X ¼ Cl, Br, I; M ¼ Mo, W) heterostructures using
