(SBI) devices which is the highest efficiency reported for Ag2BiI5 solar cell to date. The corresponding solar cell 
parameters include an open-circuit voltage (Voc) of 0.634 V and a short-circuit current (Jsc) of 3.63 mA/cm2. 
Consequently, our work presents a pathway toward developing Rudorffite solar c",Journal of Solid State Chemistry,Elsevier BV,False,Not perovskite solar cell,False
