                    <jats:italic>V</jats:italic>
                    <jats:sub>bi</jats:sub>
                    ) in PI‐treated PVSCs, stemming from a lower work function, which enhances carrier selectivity at the contact interfaces. The champion power conversion efficiency of the PVSCs is 21.47%, with a
                    <jats:italic>V</jats:italic>
