Shurong Wang a,1, Yinsheng Peng b,*,1, Long Li b, Zhineng Zhou a, Zuming Liu a, Shouli Zhou b, 
Minghai Yao b 
a Key Laboratory of Rural Energy Engineering in Yunnan Province, Yunnan Normal University, Kunming, 650500, PR China 
