Enhanced efficiency and stability of inorganic CsPbBr3 perovskite solar 
cells based on carbon counter electrode by applying PbTiO3-coated TiO2 
nanorod films as scaffold layers 
Bowen Zhang *, Zhiyong Zhao , Fangfang Yu , Diandian Chen , Fei Cheng , Hari Bala *, 
Zhanying Zhang 
