electric properties, but it also faces the issues of poor stability in high humidity environment. The introduction 
organic diammonium iodide could effectively passivate defect and improve stability in three-dimensional (3D) 
perovskite by forming Dion-Jacobson (DJ) phase two-dimensional (2D) perovskites. Here, a stable alternative, 4- 
