A B S T R A C T  
The main objective of this study was to enhance the quality of slot-die-processed perovskite film layer using an 
additive process that could improve the performance and stability of perovskite devices. To improve slot-die- 
processed perovskite, 2-hydroxyethyl acrylate (HEA) additive with -OH was utilized as an effective functional 
group. The addition of HEA controlled the perovskite’s growth, enlarged perovskite’s grain size, and reduced 
perovskite’s defects. As a result, the slot-die-processed device fabricated with HEA as additive produced a high 
efficiency of 16.08% and a good stability, maintaining an initial efficiency of 80% under air for 95 days.   
