thus decreasing the nonradiative defects in films. Furthermore, a high-quality Cs3Sb2I9-
based perovskite-layered phase is achieved at a low temperature (>100 °C). With a hole-
transport layer-free architecture (glass/FTO/c-TiO2/Cs3Sb2I9/Au, where FTO =
