Huanqin Yu a, Ting Liu a, Chen Li a, Beilei Yuan a, Jinbiao Jia b, Bingqiang Cao a,* 
a School of Material Science and Engineering, Materials Research Center for Energy and Photoelectrochemical Conversion, University of Jinan, Jinan 250022, Shandong, 
