assisted chemical bath in an aqueous TiBr4 solution. The process does not require sophisticated systems to 
implement making scaling-up easy and the precursor ensures a uniform TiO2 layer with densely-packed planar 
grains. UV light provides an alternative to the temperature-assisted CBD process and eliminates the necessity to 
stir the solution during a deposition that opens new horizons for further scaling up PSCs. The new compact layer 
