friendly and nature cellulose derivative with plentiful hydrogen bonds, cellulose acetate (CA), is introduced 
into perovskite precursor solution to serve as bifunctional green additive. The hydrogen bonding interac­
tions between the perovskite and CA could passivate the defects at the grain boundaries to suppress the 
